    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/advance-training-academy/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Advance Training Theme is a modern and feature-rich theme perfect for creating an education website for online academies, training centers, colleges, universities, and schools. Featuring a well-designed layout with a slider section to showcase campuses, events, and courses, it allows visitors to easily explore the academy’s offerings. The theme includes an About Us section, contact forms, and testimonials to help build credibility and connect with students. One of its standout features is integration with Learning Management System (LMS) plugins like Tutor LMS, LearnPress, and Masteriyo, enabling users to create, manage, and sell online courses with features such as lesson management, quizzes, practice tests, registrations, learning modules, online classes, course booking, and examination systems. Built-in support for speakers, mentors, and coaches allows professional profiles to be created and connected with students or clients. Fully responsive, cross-browser compatible, and retina ready, the theme ensures an optimal experience across devices. Its e-commerce compatibility with WooCommerce allows easy addition of online stores alongside online courses. Ideal for eLearning, Online Coaching, Skill Development Programs, Virtual Classes, Instructor Portfolios, Training Institutions, Corporate Training, Online Certification, Webinar Hosting, Digital Courses, Continuing Education, Workshops, Courses, Professional Training, Seminars, and Development Programs, the Advance Training Theme provides all the tools needed to build a professional and functional education platform. Demo: https://www.themeshopy.com/advance-training-academy/"
    },
